  "releaseNotes": "Initial state becomes declarable: pivot-filter, pivot-sort and pivot-conditional-rule child elements, with PivotGridBuilder.Filter, RowSort and ConditionalRule behind them. Anything naming a value accepts value-field plus value-aggregation and builds the value key for you. The emitted configuration is now serialized in key order, so the same configuration produces the same bytes whichever API declared it.",
